  "_readme": [
    "Links the room-link seeder (npm run db:seed:links) shares into community chats.",
    "Grouped by room theme: music, sports, gaming, food, film, tech, general. 'general' is the fallback for every room.",
    "'rooms' groups links by room name: a room whose name contains the key (e.g. 'Stray Kids') shares those links first. They also join the music pool.",
    "An entry is a URL string, or { \"url\": \"...\", \"caption\": \"text sent with it\" } to choose the message text yourself.",
    "Accepted shapes (anything else is skipped with a warning, because the app would not show a player for it):",
    "  TikTok:    https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/<19-digit id>   or   https://vt.tiktok.com/<code>/   (not /photo/ posts)",
    "  Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/reel/<shortcode>/   or   /p/<shortcode>/",
    "  Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/reel/<id>   or   /watch/?v=<id>   or   /<page>/videos/<id>   or   https://fb.watch/<code>/   or   /share/v|r/<code>/",
    "Use public posts only. Instagram and TikTok posts the crawlers already ingested are added automatically from SocialFeedItem."
  ],
